   "text": "Salesforce has announced Agentforce 2.0, the newest version of Agentforce. This is the first digital labour platform for enterprises that brings employee-facing agents directly into Slack, allowing them to work alongside your team. Agentforce 2.0 ushers in the next wave of artificial intelligence, carrying out multistep actions and advanced reasoning right in your flow of work: Slack.",
